
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
   Welcome to SketchOS - an operating system drawn in pencil!

   The kernel is a real Linux kernel; everything above it - sinit
   (PID 1), this shell (sksh), the skbox tools, the sketchd display
   server and the hand-drawn apps - was written from scratch.
  ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~

   Note: this text console uses the kernel's built-in font, which has
   no Chinese characters (they show up as little boxes). Chinese text
   works on the serial terminal and in the desktop's terminal (skterm).

   Try:  ps      svc      dmesg      cat /proc/cpuinfo      help
   Read: the welcome guide in /root (open it on the serial terminal or in skterm)
   Quit: poweroff  or  reboot

